; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Turtle Stamps
; CATEGORY: Patterns & Mandalas
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     stamp, setshape, rings, rotation
; SUMMARY:  Uses the turtle itself as a rubber stamp to print rings of turtles, stars, arrows and squares.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   The turtle can change its look with SETSHAPE and leave a copy of
;   itself on the screen with STAMP. This program stamps five rings,
;   each ring a different shape and color. The turtles in the outer
;   ring all walk round in a circle, the arrows point outwards, and
;   the stars spin as they go.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Then try typing  setshape "star stamp  yourself.
;   The shapes are: turtle triangle arrow circle square star.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * SETSHAPE changes what the turtle looks like
;   * STAMP prints the turtle's picture where it stands
;   * the turtle's heading turns the stamp, so you can aim each copy
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Make the arrows point inwards.
;   * Stamp a ring of 36 circles in rainbow colors.
;   * Make the stars spin twice as fast round the ring.
; ============================================================

; Stamp :count copies of the current shape on a circle of radius :r.
; :twist is how much each stamp turns compared with facing outwards.
to stampring :count :r :twist
  repeat :count [
    penup home
    right 360 * repcount / :count
    forward :r
    right :twist
    stamp
  ]
end

clearscreen
setbackground [245 240 225]
penup

setshape "turtle
setpencolor [40 140 70]
stampring 24 250 90          ; facing along the ring: walking round

setshape "arrow
setpencolor [220 70 50]
stampring 20 195 0           ; facing straight out

setshape "star
setpencolor [240 170 20]
repeat 16 [
  ; the stars turn a bit more each time, so they seem to spin
  home right 360 * repcount / 16 forward 140 right 25 * repcount stamp
]

setshape "square
setpencolor [60 110 210]
stampring 12 90 45

setshape "circle
setpencolor [150 60 180]
stampring 6 45 0

; finish with one big turtle-shaped stamp in the middle
home setshape "turtle setpencolor [40 40 40]
stamp
hideturtle
